    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesnt feel like fighting. it just feels like i'm drowning. everyone keeps telling me it'll get better, but i dont think i want it to get better. i just want the noise to stop. it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just... stop. does that even make sense?",
